## Refactoring Rules

### DO:

- ✅ Keep changes minimal and focused
- ✅ Maintain backward compatibility with existing API contracts
- ✅ Add/update tests for any logic changes
- ✅ Use existing patterns found in codebase
- ✅ Consolidate duplicate code into shared helpers
- ✅ Keep services under 300 lines; split if larger

### DON'T:

- ❌ Change multiple unrelated things in one commit
- ❌ Remove existing functionality without explicit request
- ❌ Add new NuGet packages without justification
- ❌ Break existing tests
- ❌ Hardcode configuration values
- ❌ Add Danish comments (use English)

