## Testing Guidelines

### Running Tests

```powershell
dotnet test Sommerhus.Api.Tests/Sommerhus.Api.Tests.csproj
```

### Test Conventions

- Name: `{Method}_{Scenario}_{ExpectedResult}`
- Use `FluentAssertions` for assertions
- Use `CustomWebApplicationFactory` for integration tests
- Isolate with in-memory SQLite database

### After Each Phase

Run full test suite to verify no regressions:

```powershell
dotnet test Sommerhus.Api.Tests/Sommerhus.Api.Tests.csproj --logger "console;verbosity=detailed"
```

