## Git Workflow

### Branch Naming

- `feature/short-description` - New features
- `refactor/short-description` - Refactoring work
- `fix/short-description` - Bug fixes

### Commit Messages

- Imperative mood: "Add feature" not "Added feature"
- Reference issues: "Fix image upload - closes #42"
- Keep under 72 characters

### Before PR

1. Run `dotnet format`
2. Run `dotnet build` with no warnings
3. Run `dotnet test` with all passing
4. Squash WIP commits

